          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>Protyze</strong>, we're proud to be recognized as pioneers in the protein supplement space—and the media is taking notice. Our revolutionary <a href=\"/collections/all-products\" title=\"All Products\"><strong>Clear Whey Protein</strong></a><strong> </strong>has been featured in leading health, fitness, and lifestyle publications across India. From in-depth articles on clean nutrition to expert reviews on protein innovations, the spotlight is on Protyze for a reason: we’re redefining how India sees and sips its protein.</p><p><strong>Why the Buzz Around Protyze Clear Whey?</strong></p><p>Unlike traditional milky protein shakes, <a href=\"/collections/anytime-clear-whey-protein\" title=\"Buy India's Best Clear Whey Protein Isolates – Anytime, Anywhere!\"><strong>Protyze Clear Whey Protein</strong></a><strong> </strong>is light, refreshing, and crystal-clear. It mixes like a fruit drink, absorbs fast, and is perfect for anyone who wants high-quality protein without the heaviness.Fitness coaches, athletes, and nutritionists are recommending it. Publications are calling it <strong>“</strong><a href=\"/collections/all-products\" title=\"All Products\"><strong>the best clear whey protein in India</strong></a><strong>”</strong>— and we couldn’t agree more. </p><p><strong>What Makes Us Stand Out</strong></p><ol><li>Made with premium <strong>Whey Protein Isolate</strong></li><li>Refreshing fruit-based flavors</li><li>Zero Added Sugar, No Bloating Technology</li><li>Fast absorption, light on the stomach</li><li>Patented formulation – <strong>India’s first Patented Clear Protein</strong></li></ol><p>We’re not just part of the conversation—we’re leading it.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
